WEBVTT

00:04.170 --> 00:06.600
A quick fleeting rain,

00:06.630 --> 00:09.270
respite for the moment and...

00:09.300 --> 00:11.840
Porridge to chow down!

00:16.010 --> 00:19.940
Is this okay? Entering without
permission and doing this sort of thing.

00:19.970 --> 00:21.070
Huh?

00:21.100 --> 00:24.820
Man, this woman doesn't quit
with her goody two shoes comments.

00:24.850 --> 00:25.700
What?

00:25.730 --> 00:29.120
When you're in the mountains,
people help each other.

00:29.150 --> 00:32.580
The pot and the rice are
here to help people in need.

00:32.610 --> 00:33.780
Is that so?

00:35.160 --> 00:40.450
O-Of course, if the poor keep helping
each other like this, we'll never get rich.

00:41.080 --> 00:42.500
So that's why you're...

00:43.910 --> 00:44.910
Huh?

00:46.670 --> 00:47.680
A bat?

00:47.710 --> 00:48.960
When did that get there?

00:52.760 --> 00:53.890
A thistle!?

00:53.920 --> 00:56.890
What? How strange!

00:59.680 --> 01:01.190
Damn it!

01:01.220 --> 01:03.390
Gramps, what's that!?

01:11.610 --> 01:13.150
What the heck is that?

01:20.660 --> 01:24.200
<i>Maiden. Light
Maiden. Light Maiden...</i>

02:55.750 --> 03:01.180
<i>Episode 7 Blossom.</i>

03:04.100 --> 03:06.470
We're in trouble!
Let's get out of here!

03:38.460 --> 03:40.300
Damn it!

03:40.760 --> 03:41.760
Dakuan!

03:48.810 --> 03:51.480
W-What's with these pests?

04:08.950 --> 04:10.130
Jubefl?

04:10.160 --> 04:11.330
Hold on tight!

04:52.200 --> 04:55.620
Well, what does he think
he's doing taking my cane?

04:57.250 --> 05:00.300
Whatever it is, only
Jubei can pull off a

05:00.330 --> 05:03.720
trick like this while
still carrying someone.

05:04.340 --> 05:07.090
Oh, will you look at this...

05:12.390 --> 05:13.490
You alright?

05:13.520 --> 05:14.770
Yeah.

05:16.190 --> 05:19.080
Gramps, where's
the root monster?

05:19.110 --> 05:21.830
Oh. Disappeared underground.

05:21.860 --> 05:24.860
Which means it's still nearby.

05:28.410 --> 05:30.840
That thing stole half
of the Dragon Stone.

05:30.870 --> 05:32.620
I'll find it and get it back.

05:33.040 --> 05:35.090
The monster's underground.

05:35.120 --> 05:37.000
It'll be quite a
task to find it.

05:38.420 --> 05:41.290
For the time being,
you keep this.

05:42.050 --> 05:43.270
No.

05:43.300 --> 05:45.800
I'd like you to hold on to it.

05:46.340 --> 05:47.340
Huh?

07:27.360 --> 07:29.790
Say, how about
changing your mind?

07:29.820 --> 07:31.150
No.

07:32.030 --> 07:37.830
If I take that now, I have neither the
power nor the confidence to protect it.

07:38.620 --> 07:45.040
But I was asked to give
this to the Light Maiden.

07:45.920 --> 07:47.220
I'll say it again.

07:47.250 --> 07:50.550
I don't think I am the Maiden.

07:51.130 --> 07:54.680
But aren't you on a
journey to find that out?

07:55.350 --> 07:56.570
You're right.

07:56.600 --> 07:57.400
Then...

07:57.430 --> 08:00.570
If I find out that I
am truly the Maiden,

08:00.600 --> 08:04.150
then I will take the
Sacred Ball at that time.

08:05.480 --> 08:07.370
What a troublesome Maiden.

08:07.400 --> 08:11.820
So until then, all the guys
looking for this'll target me.

08:12.450 --> 08:16.740
That's why you should have taken
the bodyguard job in the first place.

08:20.950 --> 08:22.120
Who goes there!?

08:24.580 --> 08:30.230
I'm alive... I've
finally made it back.

08:30.260 --> 08:33.090
What, you're still alive?

08:33.680 --> 08:35.650
Hey, come on.

08:35.680 --> 08:39.510
I was nearly killed by
that root monster woman.

08:39.970 --> 08:41.700
A root monster?

08:41.730 --> 08:43.950
You saw it in its true form?

08:43.980 --> 08:47.730
Yeah. I saw the root
turning into a woman.

08:48.060 --> 08:49.570
Where is that woman!?

08:57.950 --> 09:00.200
Looks like we're too late.

09:00.990 --> 09:02.630
Say, JubeL.

09:02.660 --> 09:04.430
The half piece of
the Sacred Stone...

09:04.460 --> 09:06.920
I don't mind holding it for you.

09:08.750 --> 09:12.800
You don't like being
hampered by that, right?

09:18.140 --> 09:19.430
Well, yeah...

09:19.850 --> 09:23.990
I intend to continue
traveling with Shigure.

09:24.020 --> 09:30.400
When Shigure understands that she is the
Maiden, I can hand it to her at that point.

09:30.940 --> 09:36.780
But, you'll have to retrieve
the other half of the Stone.

09:41.370 --> 09:45.330
What? Do you not trust me?

09:46.250 --> 09:48.500
No, that's not it.

09:54.880 --> 09:56.550
Old man, take care of this!

09:57.220 --> 09:58.970
Don't lose it!

11:00.240 --> 11:01.490
Jubefl.

11:03.700 --> 11:04.700
Jubefl.

11:07.580 --> 11:08.800
Where's the old man?

11:08.830 --> 11:09.930
Huh?

11:09.960 --> 11:11.540
He's not here?

11:12.080 --> 11:15.060
No. He's not here.

11:15.090 --> 11:18.300
What? I thought he was with you.

11:18.840 --> 11:19.840
What?

11:24.180 --> 11:28.100
Tsubute, protect that tomboy
for a little longer, alright!

11:28.640 --> 11:29.640
Huh!?

11:40.780 --> 11:43.030
Oh.

11:43.110 --> 11:46.410
Oh, Jubei.

11:46.700 --> 11:48.720
What are you doing?

11:48.750 --> 11:50.630
I'm so ashamed.

11:50.660 --> 11:54.420
Look at this wretch. That
ninja stole the Sacred Stone.

11:55.340 --> 11:58.390
Stolen? Oh, really?

11:58.420 --> 11:59.920
Well, well.

12:02.970 --> 12:07.780
W-What are you doing?
Didn't you come to help me?

12:07.810 --> 12:09.470
As if you're innocent!

12:10.020 --> 12:12.410
You tried to run
off with it yourself.

12:12.440 --> 12:14.320
You are mistaken.

12:14.350 --> 12:17.770
I was simply holding
on to it as a favor for you.

12:18.860 --> 12:20.030
This is a good opportunity.

12:20.530 --> 12:24.280
It's about time you let me in on
the secret behind the Dragon Stone.

12:25.530 --> 12:27.460
What's that?

12:27.490 --> 12:30.450
You heard me, the
secret of the Dragon Stone.

12:30.870 --> 12:32.090
What?

12:32.120 --> 12:33.620
Is that so?

12:35.750 --> 12:36.960
Here you go!

12:46.050 --> 12:48.970
It holds the secret
to the treasure!

12:49.970 --> 12:50.970
Treasure?

12:51.640 --> 12:53.990
Yes. Of a dynasty
that perished long ago.

12:54.020 --> 12:55.370
Is that right?

12:55.400 --> 12:58.230
So that's what
everyone's after...

12:59.690 --> 13:03.250
Poor thing, Shigure can't find any
peace being surrounded by thieves.

13:03.280 --> 13:05.120
And to which direction
did the woman go?

13:05.150 --> 13:10.630
West. Though the swarm of
bats is following right behind her.

13:10.660 --> 13:11.660
What?

13:12.500 --> 13:15.720
H-H-Hey, are you leaving
me behind like this!?

13:15.750 --> 13:18.000
What if a bear or
a wolf comes by!?

13:18.580 --> 13:20.310
Hope for the best.

13:20.340 --> 13:23.010
If you're lucky,
someone will rescue you.

13:23.340 --> 13:25.600
What! You heartless bastard!

13:25.630 --> 13:29.510
Hey, Jubei! Be
kind to the elderly!

14:07.510 --> 14:08.890
<i>|</i> 90f you.

14:11.760 --> 14:13.990
Where's the Dragon Stone?

14:14.020 --> 14:15.530
What are you talking about?

14:15.560 --> 14:18.600
You want to play
with me? Then...

14:19.440 --> 14:20.440
<i>Uh oh'.!</i>

14:21.110 --> 14:23.940
No, I can't let you
use your power.

14:27.070 --> 14:30.370
If you move, my wings
will tighten even more.

14:30.950 --> 14:33.710
You won't even be
able to lift a finger.

14:33.740 --> 14:37.880
I know you took off with the
Dragon Stone just a little while ago.

14:37.910 --> 14:39.640
Don't know what
you're talking about.

14:39.670 --> 14:41.630
Is that so?

14:42.210 --> 14:46.300
Where did you hide it? In
your secret chamber here?

14:49.090 --> 14:50.270
Not here.

14:50.300 --> 14:52.230
Where? Where is it!?

14:52.260 --> 14:53.860
I-I don't know!

14:53.890 --> 14:57.520
Well, then, I shall suck
your blood from here.

14:59.310 --> 15:00.770
Now, tell me.

15:07.190 --> 15:08.950
Will you tell me?

15:14.030 --> 15:16.880
Sorry to interrupt
an intimate moment.

15:16.910 --> 15:21.920
Hey root lady, you don't need to squeal
on the whereabouts of the treasure.

15:34.930 --> 15:36.060
Yikes... whoa!

15:54.870 --> 15:57.080
I shall take your blood as well.

16:01.790 --> 16:02.790
Yikes!

16:57.140 --> 16:59.430
Hey, you all rightl?

17:05.520 --> 17:06.940
H-Hey!

17:11.150 --> 17:12.870
You... you're...

17:12.900 --> 17:16.860
Uh, sorry. We're in an
oddly romantic situation.

17:17.410 --> 17:18.960
Do you want me, too?

17:18.990 --> 17:19.990
Huh?

17:25.670 --> 17:27.290
So that's your trick.

17:28.630 --> 17:31.000
You sure have a strange pet.

17:32.210 --> 17:33.270
Shut up!

17:33.300 --> 17:35.860
And who was the one trying to
take advantage of a strange woman!?

17:37.050 --> 17:40.850
Whoa. That's a misunderstanding.

17:42.310 --> 17:45.020
Anyway, sister, give me
back the Dragon Stone.

17:47.060 --> 17:49.030
The half you stole before,

17:49.060 --> 17:50.820
and the other half
you took this time!

17:51.730 --> 17:53.820
I must get them back!

17:54.150 --> 17:55.580
Shut up!

17:55.610 --> 17:57.630
The Stone belongs
to the Light Maiden.

17:57.660 --> 17:58.820
It is Hiruko's treasure!

18:01.370 --> 18:03.330
Hiruko? What's that?

18:05.000 --> 18:08.000
What? You don't know us?

18:11.460 --> 18:13.470
Hiruko or whatever you are,

18:13.500 --> 18:16.300
I do this because I was asked
to safeguard the Dragon Stone.

18:17.380 --> 18:19.520
- Asked?
- Yeah.

18:19.550 --> 18:21.770
The Maiden asked me
again just a few minutes ago.

18:21.800 --> 18:26.110
I don't want such a troublesome thing
but I am responsible to take it back.

18:26.140 --> 18:27.140
Hm?

18:34.280 --> 18:35.440
You alright?

18:38.950 --> 18:39.990
Back again!

18:41.200 --> 18:42.880
Give me that woman!

18:42.910 --> 18:44.670
Shut up!

18:44.700 --> 18:46.940
Why don't you go chase some
mosquitoes on a dry riverbed?

18:59.720 --> 19:01.010
That didn't work...

19:17.440 --> 19:18.940
You're finished!

19:32.710 --> 19:34.040
It's you!

19:46.220 --> 19:48.560
How pesky. Hm?!

20:25.800 --> 20:27.850
A pair of souped up wings.

20:29.720 --> 20:32.180
They were members
of the Kimon Clan.

20:33.060 --> 20:36.640
The half piece of the
Dragon Stone that I took

20:36.670 --> 20:40.190
from you before was
stolen by the Kimon Clan.

20:40.860 --> 20:44.110
I only have half now.

20:44.860 --> 20:49.290
Does Hiruko have something to
do with the dynasty that perished?

20:50.330 --> 20:51.580
Hiruko is the...

20:52.500 --> 20:55.330
descendant of the
ancient dynasty.

20:56.500 --> 21:01.340
You have been protecting
our Light Maiden.

21:01.840 --> 21:03.760
<i>(Thus“).</i>

21:04.630 --> 21:08.300
Thus, I will give you
the Dragon Stone.

21:13.680 --> 21:14.940
H-Hey...

21:23.490 --> 21:24.780
This is...

21:28.780 --> 21:29.780
Hey!

21:37.420 --> 21:38.920
Understood...

21:40.340 --> 21:41.550
sister.

23:30.650 --> 23:32.660
<i>Next Episode.</i>

23:34.070 --> 23:40.340
The true form of the demon haunting the
mountain pass is none other than Rengoku,

23:40.370 --> 23:43.000
the Kimon ninja who
lost her brother to Jubei.

23:43.290 --> 23:48.050
The forbidden love she carried for Jyashi
only strengthens her need for revenge.

23:48.550 --> 23:53.220
Will the sunset be stained crimson?
Or will it resemble the flames of hell?

23:53.510 --> 23:57.260
Next time on Ninja Scroll:
The Fate of Rengoku.

23:57.680 --> 23:59.070
<i>Episode 8 The Fate
of Rengoku Witness.</i>

23:59.100 --> 24:02.140
<i>Episode 8 The Fate of Rengoku</i>
